WEBVTT

01:45.000 --> 01:45.840
Madam Ji.

01:45.920 --> 01:47.840
What happened? Where's Li'er?

01:47.920 --> 01:48.920
Ms. Jiang Li is

01:49.000 --> 01:50.800
entertaining Huaixiang's folks
at Ye Residence.

01:50.880 --> 01:51.960
She said she's not coming back.

01:52.680 --> 01:53.640
Well…

01:57.120 --> 01:59.320
Why don't I go invite her myself?

02:00.120 --> 02:01.360
There's no need.

02:01.440 --> 02:04.080
Li'er brought those people here.

02:05.080 --> 02:07.080
Although they're common folks,

02:07.160 --> 02:08.840
they've met with His Majesty after all.

02:08.919 --> 02:11.560
She should be around
on such an important occasion.

02:11.640 --> 02:12.760
Old Madam.

02:12.840 --> 02:14.760
This is the welcome banquet

02:14.840 --> 02:16.160
especially prepared for Li'er.

02:16.720 --> 02:18.760
Shuran, I don't think it's a problem.

02:18.840 --> 02:19.720
She's all grown up.

02:19.800 --> 02:22.640
She won't grow
if she doesn't venture out into the world.

02:22.720 --> 02:25.520
I think Li'er is just as ambitious

02:25.600 --> 02:27.040
as my brother.

02:28.960 --> 02:30.200
Indeed.

02:30.280 --> 02:32.040
If it wasn't for her persistence,

02:32.120 --> 02:35.080
she wouldn't be successful
in petitioning to His Majesty.

02:35.160 --> 02:37.200
Indeed.

02:38.600 --> 02:41.320
Dear, let's eat.

02:41.400 --> 02:45.160
We haven't had
such a sumptuous meal for a long time.

02:45.240 --> 02:46.080
Come on.

02:46.160 --> 02:47.120
Let's eat.

02:47.920 --> 02:48.880
Here, Mr. Liu.

02:48.960 --> 02:49.960
- All together.
- Together.

02:50.040 --> 02:51.880
- All right.
- Uncle Mingyu.

02:51.960 --> 02:53.000
It's delicious indeed.

02:55.560 --> 02:57.400
- Here.
- It's good liquor.

02:58.000 --> 02:58.920
Do you want this?

02:59.400 --> 03:00.680
- Here, a toast to you.
- All right.

03:00.760 --> 03:02.400
- Here.
- Here.

03:02.480 --> 03:03.480
- Cheers.
- All right.

03:03.560 --> 03:04.920
- What a joyful day.
- Have a drink.

03:05.000 --> 03:05.880
- Is it delicious?
- Yes.

03:07.320 --> 03:09.240
- Come. Mr. Liu, here's to you again.
- All right.

03:09.320 --> 03:10.160
Ms. Jiang Li.

03:11.120 --> 03:12.040
You are…

03:12.120 --> 03:13.640
His lordship is inviting you over.

03:22.280 --> 03:24.520
Go ahead and eat. I'll be back soon.

03:44.520 --> 03:45.720
Not bad.

03:46.440 --> 03:47.640
Is only one skewer done?

03:47.720 --> 03:50.960
The Ye family is wealthy,
yet they didn't give you enough food?

03:51.040 --> 03:52.320
Have you given me time to eat?

03:52.400 --> 03:53.880
Isn't it the same to eat here?

03:54.440 --> 03:55.960
You're fuming.

04:00.680 --> 04:02.440
I'm not in the mood to joke with you.

04:02.520 --> 04:04.040
Why did you ask me to come then?

04:05.320 --> 04:06.280
Are you mad?

04:07.400 --> 04:08.400
Are you mad at me

04:08.480 --> 04:10.440
for not inviting you
to the celebration dinner?

04:10.520 --> 04:11.600
What do you think?

04:12.240 --> 04:13.560
You're Duke Su.

04:14.160 --> 04:15.280
Ye Shijie wouldn't imagine

04:15.360 --> 04:16.800
having the honor of inviting you.

04:19.839 --> 04:21.440
Is that what I want to talk to you about?

04:22.000 --> 04:23.040
Let me ask you.

04:23.120 --> 04:25.680
Who should you thank the most
for this petition to His Majesty?

04:29.600 --> 04:31.960
It's surely you.

04:32.040 --> 04:33.160
You're so calm

04:33.240 --> 04:34.600
when you tell a lie.

04:34.680 --> 04:36.200
I'm thanking you sincerely.

04:38.440 --> 04:41.000
Be it rescuing the officers at the mine,

04:41.080 --> 04:43.280
assisting the disaster victims
in Dingzhou,

04:43.360 --> 04:45.560
helping me find the girl from Zhennv Hall

04:46.080 --> 04:47.400
to confront the Eldest Princess,

04:48.000 --> 04:49.600
or setting me straight

04:49.680 --> 04:51.200
at the grave in Qingcheng Mountain,

04:52.440 --> 04:55.120
all of this couldn't have gone smoothly

04:55.640 --> 04:57.680
without you.

05:08.560 --> 05:10.480
Thank you for your help.

05:25.560 --> 05:26.840
Do you know

05:26.920 --> 05:28.480
where Ms. Situ is?

05:30.040 --> 05:32.240
We had a fight and she left.

05:32.320 --> 05:34.880
How could you have a fight with her
and make her leave?

05:34.960 --> 05:37.440
You never come here
without asking for a favor, don't you?

05:38.120 --> 05:40.360
I was wondering why you'd leave
those people behind for me.

05:41.880 --> 05:43.680
It turns out you have another intention.

05:43.760 --> 05:45.640
I'm really thankful to you.

05:46.200 --> 05:49.160
But Magistrate Xue is very sick.

05:49.240 --> 05:50.880
The imperial physicians couldn't help,

05:50.960 --> 05:52.480
so I thought of Ms. Situ.

05:52.560 --> 05:54.240
This wine tastes awful.

05:55.360 --> 05:56.200
See our visitor out.

06:02.640 --> 06:04.520
Ms. Jiang Li, this way, please.

06:09.800 --> 06:11.240
When you find out

06:11.320 --> 06:13.120
Ms. Situ's whereabouts,

06:13.200 --> 06:14.160
please let me know.

06:14.640 --> 06:16.680
I'll definitely remember your kindness.

06:18.800 --> 06:20.920
You look quite handsome too
when you're angry.

06:48.400 --> 06:49.280
Father.

06:49.360 --> 06:51.040
You used to tell me

06:52.040 --> 06:54.080
that a person needs to be upright

06:54.600 --> 06:55.760
to be a gentleman,

06:56.280 --> 06:57.920
make friends, travel everywhere,

06:58.600 --> 07:00.560
and achieve great things.

07:00.640 --> 07:02.120
If one has evil thoughts,

07:02.200 --> 07:03.600
he'll be despised by everyone.

07:04.120 --> 07:06.080
But why did this happen to you?

07:06.640 --> 07:08.640
Why do good people never get rewarded?

07:09.960 --> 07:10.800
Xue Li.

07:12.600 --> 07:14.800
Father, I'm here.

07:19.240 --> 07:20.240
Father.

07:24.440 --> 07:26.080
Those who harmed us

07:27.280 --> 07:29.400
are still living happily.

07:30.480 --> 07:32.240
I'm very close to them now.

07:33.440 --> 07:34.760
Very, very close.

07:37.280 --> 07:38.320
Justice

07:40.240 --> 07:42.200
will surely be on our side.

08:02.320 --> 08:03.160
Shijie?

08:10.160 --> 08:11.120
Why are you here?

08:11.640 --> 08:12.640
It's nothing.

08:13.200 --> 08:14.400
I just want to ask

08:14.480 --> 08:16.120
why Duke Su wanted to see you.

08:19.080 --> 08:20.640
It's just trivial things.

08:20.720 --> 08:22.000
How could it be trivial?

08:22.720 --> 08:24.760
What trivialities
can the Duke Mansion have with you?

08:25.320 --> 08:26.280
Shijie.

08:27.880 --> 08:29.960
Like I said, it's just trivial things.

08:32.120 --> 08:32.960
Jiang Li.

08:35.200 --> 08:36.720
I know you have a mind of your own

08:36.799 --> 08:38.240
and don't like to be told what to do.

08:38.320 --> 08:39.960
But I still want to ask you this.

08:41.120 --> 08:42.600
Did Duke Su give you a hard time?

08:43.679 --> 08:46.600
I've never seen him associate with anyone
in the imperial court.

08:46.680 --> 08:49.640
He's so close to you.
Did he oppress you with his power?

08:50.240 --> 08:51.080
No.

08:51.600 --> 08:53.760
Duke Su helped me.

08:54.520 --> 08:55.760
I know what to do.

08:57.200 --> 08:58.040
All right.

08:58.960 --> 09:00.280
That's good.

09:00.840 --> 09:03.920
Please take care of Magistrate Xue
during this time.

09:04.560 --> 09:05.840
I'll come by when I have time.

09:06.400 --> 09:08.920
Don't worry. I'm around.

09:13.280 --> 09:15.600
Jiang Li is sure winning people's hearts.

09:15.680 --> 09:17.240
Everyone here is siding with her.

09:17.320 --> 09:18.640
There's no place for my opinion.

09:18.720 --> 09:21.680
Madam Ji, don't worry too much.

09:21.760 --> 09:23.680
As long as she's in the Jiang family,

09:23.760 --> 09:25.560
we'll find a way to deal with her.

09:25.640 --> 09:27.960
She used to be unknown and unwelcome.

09:28.680 --> 09:30.880
No one backed her up,
so it wasn't hard to deal with her.

09:31.520 --> 09:32.520
But right now,

09:32.600 --> 09:35.200
she stands out
from all the noble ladies in the city.

09:35.760 --> 09:37.560
She's even protected by the Ye family.

09:37.640 --> 09:40.800
After returning from Luyang, she even
succeeded in petitioning to His Majesty.

09:41.880 --> 09:43.280
She has risen to fame.

09:43.360 --> 09:45.160
Even I have to be cautious with her.

09:45.760 --> 09:48.880
If we don't chase her
out of the Jiang family soon,

09:50.040 --> 09:51.560
we won't have the chance anymore.

09:51.640 --> 09:53.200
What should we do?

09:53.760 --> 09:56.600
When we find an opportunity,
we must hit the bull's eye.

09:57.640 --> 09:58.480
By the way,

09:59.320 --> 10:01.520
there's a letter
from the Princess's Mansion.

10:02.600 --> 10:05.000
Why would the Eldest Princess
write to my husband?

10:05.080 --> 10:07.440
This letter is for you.

10:07.520 --> 10:09.120
TO MADAM JI IN JIANG RESIDENCE

10:12.600 --> 10:13.880
PRINCESS WANNING'S MANSION

10:13.960 --> 10:15.680
Your Highness, I wonder

10:15.760 --> 10:18.160
why you invited me here today.

10:18.720 --> 10:19.560
Mrs. Jiang.

10:20.560 --> 10:23.600
Do you think
this Jiang Li is the real one?

10:24.200 --> 10:26.920
She is since Old Madam
and my husband said so.

10:27.000 --> 10:29.720
It seems like you acknowledge
that she's your daughter.

10:29.800 --> 10:31.560
So I have to settle the score with you,

10:31.640 --> 10:33.800
the matron of the Jiang family,

10:33.880 --> 10:35.040
for getting me grounded.

10:35.120 --> 10:36.960
If our daughter was wrong,

10:37.040 --> 10:38.520
it's of course our fault as parents.

10:39.200 --> 10:42.520
But Jiang Li didn't grow up with me

10:42.600 --> 10:44.080
and isn't my biological daughter,

10:44.160 --> 10:46.720
so it's hard to discipline her.

10:47.400 --> 10:50.280
If you want to blame me,

10:50.360 --> 10:54.000
please also be considerate of me.

10:54.080 --> 10:56.200
It must be hard

10:56.280 --> 10:57.880
to be a stepmother.

10:58.360 --> 10:59.480
Do you need my help?

10:59.560 --> 11:01.440
She's the daughter
of the Jiang family after all.

11:01.920 --> 11:03.040
If she's not taught well,

11:03.120 --> 11:05.200
the family will share
her honor and disgrace

11:05.280 --> 11:06.600
in the future.

11:06.680 --> 11:08.680
I would be very grateful

11:08.760 --> 11:10.520
for your advice.

11:11.040 --> 11:14.640
There was once a ghost in the palace.

11:14.720 --> 11:18.160
Some people in the palace
were possessed and died tragically.

11:18.920 --> 11:21.480
Everyone panicked.

11:21.560 --> 11:25.240
Later on, the Imperial Diviner
was asked to remove the impurities

11:25.920 --> 11:29.280
and it was found that a consort
was possessed by an evil spirit.

11:30.400 --> 11:32.160
His Majesty sentenced her to death

11:32.880 --> 11:34.920
to calm the chaos in the palace.

11:35.840 --> 11:37.560
Do you think Jiang Li

11:37.640 --> 11:40.800
is also possessed by an evil spirit?

11:41.400 --> 11:42.680
After listening to what you said,

11:43.280 --> 11:44.640
I also think it's odd.

11:45.320 --> 11:46.280
It's not just me.

11:46.880 --> 11:48.160
Even the elders at home

11:48.880 --> 11:51.440
think Jiang Li became another person

11:52.040 --> 11:53.720
after returning from Zhennv Hall.

11:54.320 --> 11:55.560
When I think about it now,

11:55.640 --> 11:57.480
it's just as you said.

11:58.040 --> 11:59.360
Forget other matters.

11:59.920 --> 12:01.280
Since Jiang Li came back,

12:02.880 --> 12:04.840
the daughter
of the second concubine's son,

12:04.920 --> 12:06.160
who was a smart girl,

12:07.160 --> 12:09.080
is now behaving like she lost her mind.

12:09.800 --> 12:12.040
I understand your grievance.

12:12.920 --> 12:15.400
Your family can't stay restless.

12:16.120 --> 12:18.880
I told the Imperial Diviner
what happened in the Jiang family.

12:19.560 --> 12:21.480
He likes helping people

12:21.560 --> 12:23.560
and is willing to perform exorcism
for Jiang family.

12:24.160 --> 12:26.960
But having an exorcism at home
is a big matter.

12:27.440 --> 12:29.440
Chancellor Jiang and Old Madam Jiang

12:29.520 --> 12:31.000
need to agree on this.

12:32.000 --> 12:34.400
Telling them the pros and cons

12:34.480 --> 12:37.400
shouldn't be hard for you, right?

12:38.120 --> 12:40.360
It's for your family's sake after all.

12:41.000 --> 12:43.080
Thank you for your advice, Your Highness.

12:43.720 --> 12:44.760
Have a cup of tea.

13:22.920 --> 13:25.160
Imperial Diviner,

13:27.600 --> 13:28.440
it's your turn now.

13:29.440 --> 13:31.360
TO THE IMPERIAL DIVINER

13:32.640 --> 13:34.000
I'm willing to serve Her Highness.

13:34.480 --> 13:36.560
We shall wait for your good news then.

14:09.400 --> 14:10.360
Let's take action.

14:10.440 --> 14:11.520
- Yes.
- Yes.

14:48.160 --> 14:50.240
- Heaven's will is defied.
- Heaven's will is defied.

14:50.320 --> 14:52.720
- Severe punishments will ensue.
- Severe punishments will ensue.

14:52.800 --> 14:54.800
- Heaven's will is defied.
- Heaven's will is defied.

14:54.880 --> 14:57.440
- Severe punishments will ensue.
- Severe punishments will ensue.

15:02.240 --> 15:03.400
When did this happen?

15:04.000 --> 15:05.000
It happened last night.

15:05.480 --> 15:07.240
The cause of the fire
is yet to be determined.

15:07.880 --> 15:10.040
People who passed by here
witnessed the whole process.

15:10.760 --> 15:12.280
They said the scene was very creepy.

15:13.520 --> 15:16.360
Other than these three,
are there any other casualties?

15:16.920 --> 15:19.200
- No, only the three of them.
- Heaven's will must have been defied.

15:19.280 --> 15:20.440
- Finish this up well.
- Yes.

15:20.520 --> 15:23.080
This may be related to the grounding
of the Eldest Princess.

15:23.160 --> 15:26.280
It's said that His Majesty
is wary of Prince Cheng,

15:26.360 --> 15:28.960
so he found an excuse
to put his twin sister,

15:29.040 --> 15:31.600
- Princess Wanning, in captivity.
- This matter…

15:31.680 --> 15:34.520
Prince Cheng is stabilizing the border
in the north and fighting enemies.

15:35.000 --> 15:37.800
His sister should be treated well.

15:37.880 --> 15:40.640
That's right.
This isn't a policy of benevolence indeed.

15:44.920 --> 15:45.800
My lord.

15:48.440 --> 15:50.080
The coroner already took the corpses back.

15:50.160 --> 15:52.600
More time is needed
to determine what exactly happened.

15:53.160 --> 15:54.840
Someone must have done it deliberately.

15:54.920 --> 15:57.200
Find out the truth soon
to stop the rumors.

15:57.280 --> 15:58.280
Yes.

15:58.880 --> 16:00.240
Someone is feeling restless.

16:01.280 --> 16:03.400
It seems like something big
will happen in the capital.

16:04.040 --> 16:06.600
Should I send a message to Ms. Jiang Li

16:06.680 --> 16:07.720
to tell her to go out less?

16:09.120 --> 16:10.040
Let's go.

16:14.800 --> 16:16.680
Do you think his lordship wants me

16:16.760 --> 16:17.600
to do it or not?

16:17.680 --> 16:19.160
If he didn't want you to go,

16:19.880 --> 16:21.800
he would've asked you to get caned.

16:21.880 --> 16:22.800
That's right.

16:22.880 --> 16:23.800
I bet

16:23.880 --> 16:25.840
he's still angry with Ms. Jiang Li.

16:25.920 --> 16:27.280
Even when he thinks about her,

16:27.360 --> 16:28.760
he doesn't want to say it out loud.

16:41.280 --> 16:42.440
Miss, have some stew.

16:47.240 --> 16:49.680
Miss, Duke Su sent a letter saying

16:49.760 --> 16:51.040
it hasn't been peaceful recently.

16:51.120 --> 16:52.440
He wants you not to go out often.

16:53.040 --> 16:54.520
It's no wonder that they're restless

16:55.920 --> 16:57.240
after the imperial court meeting.

16:58.320 --> 16:59.320
But fortunately,

16:59.400 --> 17:00.680
his lordship and Old Madam Jiang

17:00.760 --> 17:01.760
are on your side now.

17:02.520 --> 17:04.440
When you didn't come back
for the welcome banquet,

17:04.520 --> 17:06.880
Ji Shuran wanted to use it to attack
and debase you.

17:07.480 --> 17:09.400
I didn't expect
that his lordship and Old Madam

17:09.480 --> 17:10.800
would put in good a word for you.

17:10.880 --> 17:12.200
At the main hall,

17:12.839 --> 17:15.880
Eldest Princess wanted Chancellor Jiang
to open the coffin and examine the body.

17:16.520 --> 17:19.040
He refused and shielded me from her sword.

17:20.200 --> 17:21.119
For now,

17:21.200 --> 17:23.119
I don't think he would investigate
my identity.

17:23.960 --> 17:25.359
But he's already starting to doubt

17:25.440 --> 17:26.920
my identity.

17:27.480 --> 17:28.680
To Ji Shuran,

17:29.720 --> 17:31.680
this is the best time
for her to deal with me.

17:31.760 --> 17:34.280
But even the Eldest Princess
can't do anything to us,

17:34.360 --> 17:35.600
so we don't need to fear them.

17:35.680 --> 17:38.520
The Eldest Princess has made
a killing move against me.

17:39.840 --> 17:41.120
Although we survived that,

17:41.600 --> 17:43.320
she surely won't give up.

17:44.280 --> 17:45.960
Despite being grounded now,

17:46.040 --> 17:48.880
I'm afraid she'll still
find a way to kill me.

17:51.560 --> 17:52.400
Tong'er,

17:53.880 --> 17:55.360
we can say

17:55.440 --> 17:58.680
that we're surrounded now.

17:59.320 --> 18:00.360
Are you afraid?

18:00.440 --> 18:04.280
Miss, I'm not afraid.
I'm not scared anymore.

18:04.840 --> 18:06.240
I think we're fortunate enough

18:06.320 --> 18:07.640
to have come this far.

18:07.720 --> 18:10.000
Not only am I not afraid,
but I also feel excited.

18:11.680 --> 18:13.360
Even if we can't make it to the end,

18:14.040 --> 18:15.600
I would like to move forward more.

18:16.520 --> 18:18.840
Seeing more bad people get punished,

18:20.760 --> 18:22.200
I think it's worth it.

18:23.960 --> 18:26.360
We'll surely make it to the end.

18:29.840 --> 18:34.640
IMPERIAL DIVINER OFFICE

18:34.720 --> 18:35.880
Madam Ji, is this the place?

18:38.720 --> 18:39.920
IMPERIAL DIVINER OFFICE

18:40.480 --> 18:41.800
Pick me up after two hours.

18:42.280 --> 18:43.240
Yes.

18:54.720 --> 18:57.880
VISITOR CARD

19:09.240 --> 19:10.400
Please wait here.

19:10.480 --> 19:11.880
The Imperial Diviner will meet you.

19:43.440 --> 19:44.520
It has been so long.

19:45.440 --> 19:47.040
Why isn't the Imperial Diviner here yet?

20:33.760 --> 20:34.600
Hit him.

20:35.440 --> 20:37.800
No!

20:37.880 --> 20:40.480
Stop it!

20:40.560 --> 20:42.000
Father.

20:42.560 --> 20:43.600
Father.

20:43.680 --> 20:45.480
Stop hitting him!

20:48.680 --> 20:49.520
No!

20:51.600 --> 20:52.640
Father.

20:53.360 --> 20:54.200
Father.

20:54.280 --> 20:55.360
Stop hitting him!

20:56.280 --> 20:57.720
Stop it!

21:01.320 --> 21:03.720
Mrs. Jiang, you've come.

21:08.760 --> 21:12.560
I came to see you
upon the Eldest Princess's instruction.

21:13.120 --> 21:15.120
I noticed that you're interested
in that painting.

21:18.360 --> 21:19.440
Not really.

21:19.520 --> 21:20.600
But this painting

21:21.160 --> 21:22.800
is very similar to a painting

21:22.880 --> 21:24.360
of a previous painter of mine.

21:24.960 --> 21:28.320
Are you still
in contact with that painter?

21:28.880 --> 21:31.160
He passed away in an accident.

21:31.240 --> 21:34.200
Was it an accident
or was it intentionally done?

21:36.400 --> 21:37.560
What do you mean?

21:42.000 --> 21:46.600
LIU WENCAI

21:56.360 --> 21:57.320
You…

21:58.560 --> 21:59.840
You're Liu Wencai.

22:03.320 --> 22:04.160
That's impossible.

22:04.880 --> 22:05.840
It can't be.

22:07.760 --> 22:09.800
You thought that fire

22:10.360 --> 22:12.280
could make me disappear from this world?

23:33.280 --> 23:34.200
Wencai.

23:35.280 --> 23:36.840
You're still painting me.

23:41.120 --> 23:43.000
I can only paint with my left hand now.

23:43.680 --> 23:44.560
How was your life

23:45.960 --> 23:47.160
in the past few years?

23:47.880 --> 23:49.240
I used up all my savings

23:50.080 --> 23:51.520
to open a little shop in my hometown.

23:52.560 --> 23:55.440
I painted and sold my paintings.

23:56.520 --> 23:58.000
I thought my fellow villagers

23:58.080 --> 23:59.080
would care for me.

24:00.280 --> 24:01.920
I didn't expect them to bully me even more

24:03.040 --> 24:04.440
when they saw that I was disabled.

24:05.520 --> 24:07.160
When someone wanted to tear your painting,

24:08.280 --> 24:09.480
I struggled to defend it.

24:09.560 --> 24:10.960
I hit him out of anger

24:12.360 --> 24:13.840
and I was sued.

24:15.040 --> 24:16.560
I couldn't stay in my hometown anymore,

24:17.040 --> 24:20.560
so I could only bring my paintings
and come to see you in the capital.

24:21.120 --> 24:23.320
Since you know that I'm Mrs. Jiang now,

24:25.120 --> 24:26.560
you shouldn't have come to see me.

24:27.120 --> 24:28.360
I thought you wouldn't come.

24:30.560 --> 24:31.560
But you did.

25:37.560 --> 25:40.200
Shuran.

25:54.520 --> 25:55.760
You want to kill me?

25:56.360 --> 25:57.680
You shouldn't have come to see me.

26:02.240 --> 26:03.520
I don't owe you anything anymore.

26:04.520 --> 26:05.480
Shuran.

26:16.040 --> 26:16.880
Shuran.

26:18.760 --> 26:19.600
Shuran!

26:24.240 --> 26:25.080
Shuran!

26:25.880 --> 26:26.760
Shuran, come back!

26:29.080 --> 26:32.000
Ji Shuran, come back!

26:33.760 --> 26:35.760
Ji Shuran!

27:23.720 --> 27:25.440
Let go of me.

27:27.000 --> 27:27.840
Look at me.

27:30.080 --> 27:31.080
Look at me!

27:31.840 --> 27:33.560
I tried so hard to protect my face

27:34.280 --> 27:36.480
with my hands in that fire.

27:37.200 --> 27:38.040
I thought

27:38.720 --> 27:40.760
if I could luckily survive,

27:41.760 --> 27:43.920
I needed to make sure
you could recognize me.

27:44.960 --> 27:45.880
But it's all right.

27:46.520 --> 27:48.840
If you hadn't intended to kill me then,

27:50.600 --> 27:52.840
I wouldn't have had this opportunity now.

27:53.760 --> 27:55.280
You went to see the Eldest Princess

27:56.400 --> 27:58.600
and told her there were evil spirits
in the Jiang family.

28:02.040 --> 28:03.680
You want to get your revenge on me.

28:04.280 --> 28:05.920
If I wanted to get my revenge on you,

28:06.760 --> 28:08.160
I wouldn't have waited until today.

28:09.520 --> 28:10.600
It has been so many years.

28:12.240 --> 28:13.680
Why do you only appear now?

28:14.640 --> 28:16.560
Your life had gone so smoothly before.

28:17.600 --> 28:19.040
Even if I found you,

28:20.440 --> 28:22.360
I couldn't have made you
do anything for me.

28:23.000 --> 28:23.840
But right now…

28:28.080 --> 28:29.920
you finally need to beg me.

28:32.800 --> 28:34.560
I can get rid of Jiang Li for you.

28:35.120 --> 28:36.240
It all depends on you.

28:52.600 --> 28:53.520
Madam Ji, you're back.

28:56.680 --> 28:57.520
Madam Ji.

28:58.480 --> 28:59.680
What happened to you?

28:59.760 --> 29:01.520
I'm fine. I would like to be alone.

29:02.760 --> 29:05.120
Take a break first.

29:05.200 --> 29:06.120
Madam Ji.

29:07.360 --> 29:08.560
I'm fine. Leave first.

29:09.520 --> 29:10.360
Leave!

29:30.080 --> 29:31.040
Leave now.

29:47.360 --> 29:49.760
JIANG RESIDENCE

29:55.320 --> 29:56.160
My lady.

30:00.960 --> 30:07.760
JIANG RESIDENCE

30:07.840 --> 30:11.240
JIANG RESIDENCE

30:13.680 --> 30:14.800
Didn't Mr. Zhou come?

30:15.520 --> 30:17.520
- No.
- It serves her right.

30:18.160 --> 30:20.640
Her husband didn't come back
to visit his mother-in-law with her.

30:20.720 --> 30:22.120
Does she think she's favored?

30:24.840 --> 30:27.040
Has he sent anything over recently?

30:27.120 --> 30:29.200
Mr. Zhou did send things over for a while.

30:29.280 --> 30:30.400
But Ms. Sun intercepted them.

30:30.960 --> 30:32.720
Since you didn't give any replies,

30:32.800 --> 30:33.960
he stopped sending things over.

30:43.080 --> 30:43.920
Yes.

30:49.360 --> 30:50.680
Ms. Yu'e is funny.

30:50.760 --> 30:51.640
So what if she's back?

30:51.720 --> 30:53.000
What is there to brag about?

30:55.840 --> 30:56.680
Madam Ji.

31:04.600 --> 31:07.720
Is Zhou Yanbang
still sending things to Ruoyao?

31:08.320 --> 31:09.160
Yes.

31:09.760 --> 31:11.320
I'm on guard.

31:11.400 --> 31:14.840
Have Mr. Qi propose marriage
as soon as possible.

31:16.880 --> 31:19.560
If Ruoyao continues
to be entangled with Zhou Yanbang,

31:20.680 --> 31:22.080
something bad will happen sooner or later.

31:22.160 --> 31:23.240
Madam Ji.

31:23.320 --> 31:24.960
You look terrible.

31:25.040 --> 31:26.760
- I'm fine.
- Let me get you a physician.

31:26.840 --> 31:28.040
There's no need. I'm all right.

31:38.720 --> 31:40.400
- Our daughter is promising.
- Put it there.

31:40.480 --> 31:41.840
- She brought so many things.
- You're rarely back

31:41.920 --> 31:43.320
- and you bring so much stuff.
- Put them here.

31:44.160 --> 31:45.440
Open them.

31:46.560 --> 31:47.480
Put them on the side.

31:56.080 --> 31:57.840
Aren't these gifts

31:58.680 --> 32:00.560
your dowry?

32:01.080 --> 32:02.440
It must have been a mistake.

32:02.520 --> 32:04.840
I got many presents from the Zhou family.

32:05.400 --> 32:06.520
Keep them first.

32:06.600 --> 32:07.880
I'll bring them home next time.

32:09.480 --> 32:12.680
Yu'e, is the Zhou family
really treating you well?

32:13.520 --> 32:15.000
Did they mistreat you?

32:15.560 --> 32:18.080
Don't worry, Mother. I'm well.

32:18.640 --> 32:20.240
It's all because my rank is too low

32:20.760 --> 32:21.880
and I'm an illegitimate son.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.320
I've dragged you down.

32:24.440 --> 32:25.960
If your in-laws gave you attitude,

32:26.040 --> 32:27.080
you should…

32:29.240 --> 32:30.280
What's wrong?

32:30.360 --> 32:31.400
Nothing.

32:31.480 --> 32:32.600
Let me see it.

32:33.520 --> 32:35.240
Let me see.

32:38.320 --> 32:39.200
What happened?

32:39.760 --> 32:41.720
It's nothing. I fell.

32:41.800 --> 32:43.480
This isn't an injury from a fall.

32:44.040 --> 32:45.560
Mother, lower your voice.

32:46.120 --> 32:47.560
Did Zhou Yanbang hit you?

32:50.600 --> 32:51.440
Dear.

32:52.000 --> 32:53.760
I'm going back
to my parents' house tomorrow.

32:54.320 --> 32:55.600
Can you--

32:55.680 --> 32:56.560
Shut up!

32:58.360 --> 33:02.160
I said I don't want to see you.

33:14.840 --> 33:15.680
Jiang Li.

33:17.600 --> 33:18.840
Jiang Li is back?

33:18.920 --> 33:19.800
Yes.

33:23.240 --> 33:24.560
Jiang Li is back.

33:27.080 --> 33:28.240
Jiang Li is back.

33:28.320 --> 33:29.840
What does it have to do with you?

33:30.320 --> 33:31.520
Isn't Jiang Ruoyao enough?

33:31.600 --> 33:33.200
Are you still thinking about Jiang Li?

33:33.280 --> 33:34.120
Go away!

33:35.400 --> 33:38.000
If you didn't get onto my bed that night,

33:38.080 --> 33:40.240
Jiang Li and I wouldn't end up like this!

33:40.920 --> 33:41.880
You bitch.

33:48.080 --> 33:50.120
How decent do you think Jiang Li is?

33:50.920 --> 33:52.280
Jiang Li personally gave me

33:52.760 --> 33:54.280
the note you gave her.

33:54.360 --> 33:56.800
Do you think she likes you? Dream on.

33:56.880 --> 33:59.080
That's just your wishful thinking.

34:06.480 --> 34:07.760
What do you mean?

34:08.480 --> 34:09.760
What exactly happened?

34:11.760 --> 34:13.159
Make it clear to me!

34:14.120 --> 34:16.080
She planned for me to see you.

34:16.639 --> 34:18.800
I didn't tell you because she's my sister.

34:18.880 --> 34:20.320
She has no interest in you at all.

34:21.360 --> 34:23.280
That's why she pushed me to you.

34:30.719 --> 34:32.960
Nice one, Jiang Li.

34:33.800 --> 34:35.880
As long as I bear his child

34:36.600 --> 34:37.760
and give birth to a boy,

34:38.840 --> 34:42.199
I'll become the matron of the Zhou family.

34:43.000 --> 34:44.320
Everything will be fine by then.

34:49.280 --> 34:50.120
My lady.

34:50.600 --> 34:52.480
Mr. Zhou isn't treating Jiang Yu'e well.

34:52.560 --> 34:54.679
Those presents
weren't from the Zhou family.

34:54.760 --> 34:56.639
It was the dowry of Jiang Yu'e.

34:58.640 --> 34:59.600
I knew it.

34:59.680 --> 35:01.520
He would never fall for Jiang Yu'e.

35:01.600 --> 35:04.560
Mr. Zhou seemed
to have mentioned Ms. Jiang Li too.

35:05.240 --> 35:07.400
Jiang Yu'e also said
that in the palace banquet,

35:07.480 --> 35:09.560
- Mr. Zhou wanted to invite Ms. Jiang Li--
- Impossible.

35:21.040 --> 35:23.560
He must still love me.

35:25.560 --> 35:26.520
Madam Ji.

35:34.560 --> 35:35.400
You may go.

35:35.480 --> 35:36.320
Yes.

35:37.840 --> 35:38.720
Yao'er.

35:38.800 --> 35:40.400
I've already arranged your marriage

35:40.480 --> 35:42.160
with the Qi family.

35:43.240 --> 35:45.040
Let's meet him together.

35:45.120 --> 35:47.040
Mr. Qi is handsome.

35:47.120 --> 35:48.280
You two would get along well.

35:50.160 --> 35:51.760
I'm talking to you. Did you hear me?

35:54.000 --> 35:54.840
I heard you.

35:55.320 --> 35:56.920
Do you know

35:57.000 --> 36:00.080
how many families I inquired for you?

36:00.920 --> 36:03.200
You just canceled an engagement
and have a bad reputation.

36:03.760 --> 36:05.960
It wasn't easy
to find you another good partner.

36:06.480 --> 36:07.800
The Qi family has a high status.

36:07.880 --> 36:10.440
That child also
conducts himself well with people.

36:10.520 --> 36:11.680
You should be more attentive.

36:12.240 --> 36:13.240
Get changed.

36:13.800 --> 36:16.840
I'm tired today. Let's do it another day.

36:20.720 --> 36:22.440
What's with you recently?

36:22.520 --> 36:24.360
You don't dress well.

36:24.440 --> 36:25.960
You also haven't been eating well.

36:26.040 --> 36:27.680
You look like you're half dead.

36:28.560 --> 36:30.000
I really can't go today.

36:30.560 --> 36:31.400
I'm very tired.

36:31.880 --> 36:34.800
If not today, then we'll go in a few days.

36:34.880 --> 36:36.760
You have to go anyway.

36:36.840 --> 36:38.480
Does it matter if I go?

36:39.120 --> 36:40.560
Isn't this set in stone already?

36:48.200 --> 36:49.040
What is this?

36:49.120 --> 36:51.360
Mother. What are you doing, Mother?

36:51.440 --> 36:53.960
Mother.

36:55.560 --> 36:56.400
Mother.

37:03.000 --> 37:04.520
Eternity may come to an end.

37:05.200 --> 37:07.360
But this hatred will never end.

37:10.560 --> 37:14.120
You're still in touch
with Zhou Yanbang behind my back.

37:14.680 --> 37:15.880
This is none of your business.

37:15.960 --> 37:17.360
- Ms. Sun.
- Yes.

37:17.440 --> 37:20.120
Bring over the newly-made clothes
for Ruoyao.

37:21.000 --> 37:22.680
You must go to see Mr. Qi

37:22.760 --> 37:24.240
the day after tomorrow.

37:25.320 --> 37:26.280
Mother.

37:26.840 --> 37:27.680
Mother.

37:28.520 --> 37:30.000
If you don't listen to me this time,

37:30.480 --> 37:32.240
I won't consider you
as my daughter anymore.

37:42.320 --> 37:43.160
Jiang Li.

37:46.120 --> 37:46.960
Yu'e.

37:48.960 --> 37:49.960
It has been a while.

37:50.040 --> 37:51.400
I was in a rush.

37:51.480 --> 37:53.240
I haven't had time to thank you yet.

37:53.320 --> 37:54.560
You don't need to thank me.

37:55.040 --> 37:56.160
I didn't do anything
that deserves your gratitude.

37:56.720 --> 37:58.040
Of course you did.

37:59.160 --> 38:00.400
Without you,

38:00.480 --> 38:02.840
I wouldn't be able to marry
into the Zhou family.

38:02.920 --> 38:03.920
In the future,

38:04.000 --> 38:06.480
if I become the matron of the Zhou family,

38:06.560 --> 38:10.440
I'll definitely come back
to thank you properly.

38:14.680 --> 38:15.840
I'm back!

38:16.920 --> 38:17.880
Yu'e.

38:21.240 --> 38:22.360
She's ignoring me.

38:23.000 --> 38:23.840
Little Ruirui.

38:24.800 --> 38:25.640
I'm back.

38:27.200 --> 38:28.200
Let me tell you.

38:28.280 --> 38:30.360
The disaster in Dingzhou is over.

38:30.440 --> 38:32.200
Liu Xu and her father
are finalizing things.

38:32.280 --> 38:34.320
We'll be worshiping our ancestors,
so I came back.

38:34.400 --> 38:35.360
I heard about it.

38:35.840 --> 38:38.920
What you did was thrilling.

38:39.000 --> 38:40.760
It was such a shame that I wasn't around

38:40.840 --> 38:41.680
when this happened.

38:41.760 --> 38:44.440
If you really wanted to witness it,
you wouldn't have gone to Dingzhou.

38:45.000 --> 38:47.080
What are you talking about?
Of course I wanted to.

38:47.160 --> 38:48.840
You probably came back suddenly

38:48.920 --> 38:50.160
because you made Liu Xu mad

38:50.240 --> 38:51.160
and were told to leave.

38:51.240 --> 38:53.800
What are you talking about?
How is that possible?

38:53.880 --> 38:56.760
- Am I that kind of person? Impossible.
- You're that kind of person.

38:56.840 --> 38:58.840
Did Liu Xu write to you?

39:01.880 --> 39:03.760
Tell me.

39:04.640 --> 39:08.120
Jiang Jingrui, don't you know
men and women should keep their distance?

39:08.200 --> 39:09.480
Tell me.

39:09.560 --> 39:10.440
No.

39:10.960 --> 39:12.440
- No way.
- Come on!

39:12.520 --> 39:13.520
- Tell me. Hurry.
- I won't.

39:28.760 --> 39:29.600
Why can't I

39:30.080 --> 39:32.400
even choose who to love?

39:33.240 --> 39:34.120
My lady.

39:35.920 --> 39:36.840
A letter from Mr. Zhou.

39:37.600 --> 39:38.440
Why would he…

39:44.160 --> 39:45.280
Today at 9 p.m.,

39:45.360 --> 39:47.520
meet me at the back alley.

39:48.120 --> 39:49.520
My lady, don't be reckless.

39:49.600 --> 39:52.120
Madam Ji wants to set you up with Mr. Qi.

39:52.200 --> 39:54.120
If she finds out…

39:54.760 --> 39:55.600
Besides,

39:56.080 --> 39:58.680
Mr. Zhou hasn't written to you
for a while.

39:58.760 --> 40:00.440
He suddenly reached out to you.

40:00.520 --> 40:01.720
And he didn't come to visit you

40:01.800 --> 40:03.640
but asked you out instead.

40:03.720 --> 40:06.880
You don't get it. He has always loved me.

40:07.440 --> 40:08.280
My lady.

40:14.080 --> 40:14.920
TO JIANG RUOYAO

40:24.960 --> 40:27.000
Did you touch the item in my box?

40:27.080 --> 40:28.120
No.

40:28.200 --> 40:30.440
Has anyone been here today?

40:30.520 --> 40:32.840
Ms. Sun came
to bring you these new clothes.

40:32.920 --> 40:35.120
She said Madam Ji
especially tailor-made them

40:35.200 --> 40:37.280
for your meeting
with the Qi family in two days.

40:37.360 --> 40:38.640
She told you to keep them well.

40:39.280 --> 40:42.280
She also wants you
to carefully think about the meeting

40:42.360 --> 40:43.520
and pull yourself together.

40:44.080 --> 40:45.160
It was Mother.

40:45.920 --> 40:47.760
She took my hairpin.

40:50.400 --> 40:51.240
My lady.

40:51.320 --> 40:53.840
You think this would make me
stop thinking about him and give up?

40:54.320 --> 40:55.200
Dream on.

41:04.840 --> 41:07.960
Madam Jiang, I just saw Mr. Zhou
go out to see Jiang Ruoyao.

41:13.440 --> 41:14.280
Madam Jiang.

41:14.760 --> 41:16.560
If this gets out of hand,
it won't be good for anyone.

41:17.040 --> 41:18.640
Besides, Mr. Zhou says

41:18.720 --> 41:21.120
that he's sleeping in the study.

41:24.280 --> 41:27.120
I got it. Leave.

41:28.160 --> 41:29.320
It's time for me to sleep too.

41:30.240 --> 41:31.080
Yes.

41:50.120 --> 41:51.280
Yao'er.

42:01.040 --> 42:01.880
Dear.

42:02.360 --> 42:04.280
I made an appointment
with Ruixiang Store's tailor

42:04.360 --> 42:05.480
to make you clothes.

42:06.560 --> 42:07.600
Or

42:08.160 --> 42:10.280
should I get the tailor here

42:10.960 --> 42:12.080
to save you the trouble?

42:14.880 --> 42:17.000
I told the kitchen
to make this especially for you.

42:17.480 --> 42:19.000
Here. Have another one.

42:19.680 --> 42:22.000
Am I a pig? You're feeding me so much.

42:28.480 --> 42:29.480
Dear, where are you going?

42:29.560 --> 42:30.680
Don't bother me.

42:30.760 --> 42:32.280
I know that you went out last night.

42:35.920 --> 42:36.760
What did you say?

42:37.320 --> 42:38.360
Why don't I ask you

42:40.200 --> 42:41.560
what you're up to?

42:41.640 --> 42:43.960
I'm your wife.

42:44.720 --> 42:46.600
Why did you have to see Jiang Ruoyao?

42:48.000 --> 42:50.400
Isn't it good to live peacefully with me?

42:57.280 --> 42:58.560
How dare you follow me?

43:00.000 --> 43:00.920
I'm warning you.

43:02.000 --> 43:04.280
Don't you tell anyone about last night.

43:05.640 --> 43:07.560
Otherwise, I won't forgive you.

43:14.000 --> 43:14.840
Dear.

43:21.200 --> 43:23.440
Are you really learning medicine

43:23.520 --> 43:24.760
to treat Magistrate Xue?

43:24.840 --> 43:27.280
It won't hurt to learn medicine.

43:28.520 --> 43:30.560
By the way, let me tell you something.

43:31.080 --> 43:33.680
Jiang Ruoyao went on a blind date today.

43:34.240 --> 43:36.480
She went there
and came back with a long face.

43:37.080 --> 43:39.280
It seems she has upset the Qi family too.

43:39.360 --> 43:43.000
Ji Shuran went into her courtyard earlier
and she's still there after so many hours.

43:43.080 --> 43:44.160
She must be scolding her.

43:44.760 --> 43:47.360
I didn't expect Jiang Ruoyao
to also be so…

43:47.440 --> 43:48.440
Stupid.

43:48.520 --> 43:49.520
What did you say?

43:50.320 --> 43:53.320
It's normal to be blinded by love.

43:53.400 --> 43:55.240
It's stupid
when the person is not worth it.

43:55.800 --> 43:57.480
But Jiang Ruoyao is quite pitiful.

43:57.560 --> 43:59.240
Judging from Ji Shuran's personality,

43:59.960 --> 44:02.720
even if it doesn't work out
with the Qi family,

44:03.240 --> 44:04.280
there will be

44:04.360 --> 44:06.720
other families to come.

44:07.280 --> 44:08.840
If she doesn't know how to resist her,

44:09.480 --> 44:10.440
she can't blame anyone.

44:10.520 --> 44:12.280
Do you think everyone is like you?

44:12.360 --> 44:14.360
Acting recklessly.

44:15.080 --> 44:16.160
But that's good too.

44:16.240 --> 44:17.440
When they're busy,

44:18.640 --> 44:20.320
they don't have time to bother you.

44:24.880 --> 44:26.480
The coroner has finished the examination.

44:26.560 --> 44:27.640
Nothing unusual is found.

44:27.720 --> 44:29.760
They haven't found out
the will-o'-the-wisp's cause.

44:29.840 --> 44:31.680
It's written in Records of Diverse Matters

44:31.760 --> 44:33.560
that when there is death from war,

44:33.640 --> 44:36.000
the accumulated human and horse blood
turns into phosphorus over time.

44:36.080 --> 44:38.320
Phosphorus on the ground
is like dew from plants.

44:38.400 --> 44:39.680
It's almost invisible.

44:39.760 --> 44:41.840
When someone touches it,

44:41.920 --> 44:43.480
his body will illuminate.

44:43.560 --> 44:46.280
Rotting wood and corpses

44:46.360 --> 44:47.680
may spontaneously combust

44:49.480 --> 44:51.320
and produce a phenomenon
like will-o'-the-wisp.

44:57.760 --> 44:59.000
The so-called supernatural

44:59.080 --> 45:01.720
is just people playing tricks.

45:01.800 --> 45:03.200
I see.

45:03.280 --> 45:05.280
The will-o'-the-wisp was man-made.

45:05.360 --> 45:08.360
Those who were burned to death
must have acted by order of someone.

45:09.520 --> 45:11.240
Otherwise, they wouldn't say those things.

45:11.320 --> 45:14.280
Investigate the whereabouts
of the deceased before they died.

45:14.360 --> 45:15.760
Find common ground.

45:15.840 --> 45:16.680
Yes.

